//@ spec: l.103, l.111, l.74
// The part row changes each part by ⇝ₚ (l.103), the object, enum and part rows
// and ! ⇝ U alone, so a part takes no cast and no conversion (l.111, l.74);
// none of them goes from u8 to u16, so Option<u8> does not coerce to
// Option<u16>.
assert coerce(Option<u8>, Option<u16>) == none;
